nitro-control (universal)
=========================

Install on ANY Kali Linux:
  sudo dpkg -i nitro-control_2.0.0_all.deb
  sudo apt-get install -f -y

First steps:
  nitro-fan probe          # detect hardware
  nitro-fan-gui            # GUI always works (monitor)
  sudo nitro-fan install-nbfc   # if you want fan control
  sudo nitro-fan install-rgb    # Acer Nitro/Predator RGB only

Support matrix:
  Any Kali laptop     → GUI: temp, RAM, SSD heat
  NBFC-supported model → fan auto/manual
  Acer Nitro/Predator  → keyboard RGB (after install-rgb)

Probe example:
  nitro-fan probe
